ves, avoiding any premature referencing of code or project specifics. I'm essentially poised and ready for their next directive.\n\n\n","agentMetadata":{"coderAgent":{"kind":""},"model":""},"modelDisplayName":"3 Pro Preview","modelID":"chat-gemini-3-0-pro-preview-paid-tier"},{"entity":"USER","markdownText":"Well, First off, We're going to focus our main deployments in IaaC or IaaS. \n\nTHen we can deploy onsie twosie modules or services against workers and free services that support smaller storage, compute and bandwidth, if that makes sense. \n\nSo all our IaaC and IaaS would just have bare metal Nexus deployments. Full modules","chatSectionId":"1","ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"c:\\Users\\heidi\\.gemini\\project\\Nexus\\nexus-core\\nexus-core\\cognikube_full.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"remoteContexts":null,"remoteRepositories":[],"otherFiles":[{"path":"c:\\Users\\heidi\\.gemini\\project\\Nexus\\nexus-core\\nexus-core\\Untitled-5.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"COLOCATED"},{"path":"c:\\Users\\heidi\\.gemini\\project\\Nexus\\nexus-core\\nexus-core\\cognikube_wrapperv2.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"COLOCATED"},{"path":"c:\\Users\\heidi\\.gemini\\project\\Nexus\\nexus-core\\nexus-core\\Untitled-2.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"COLOCATED"},{"path":"c:\\Users\\heidi\\.gemini\\project\\Nexus\\nexus-core\\nexus-core\\memory_substrate_protocol.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"COLOCATED"},{"path":"c:\\Users\\heidi\\.gemini\\project\\Nexus\\nexus-core\\nexus-core\\Untitled-4.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"COLOCATED"},{"path":"c:\\Users\\heidi\\.gemini\\project\\Nexus\\nexus-core\\nexus-core\\nexus_gatewayv1.py","language":"python","selection":{"start":0,"end":0},"includedReason":"COLOCATED"},{"pat