To support this pivot, I've prepared the **IaaC (Infrastructure as Code)** foundation using Terraform to deploy your "Bare Metal Nexus" on Google Cloud (matching your existing project ID). I've also updated the Core Monolith script to recognize when it's running in this new IaaS environment.

### 1. Update Nexus Core to Detect IaaS Platform
I'm updating the platform detection in your monolith to respect an explicit `NEXUS_PLATFORM` environment variable, which we'll set in the IaaS deployment.

```diff
--- c/Users/heidi/.gemini/project/Nexus/nexus-core/nexus-core/Untitled-5.py
+++ c/Users/heidi/.gemini/project/Nexus/nexus-core/nexus-core/Untitled-5.py
@@ -114,6 +114,8 @@
         self._auto_deploy_dependencies()
 
