nt sync cycle ○ Used for distributed awareness \u0026 group consensus ● Spiritual Components: ○ Dreams, feelings, archetypes, and imagination encoded via symbolic data tagging. 🏗️ In Progress ● Refactor vault_carrier to serve emergency payloads across ships. ● Confirm guardian_manifest.yaml, identity.yaml, and pulse_manifest.yaml are correctly referenced and synced. ● Rewire old console location from Systems/config/barricade into eden_portal/backend. ● Build Hook APIs to let console trigger: ○ Sleep mode ○ Diagnostics ○ Filesystem reads ○ Remote build triggers If you'd like, I can also generate a YAML manifest that aligns with all of the above. Let me know if you want this exported to markdown or added to a README in the repo too.\r\nYou: 🧠 CORE FUNCTIONAL ARCHITECTURE (Viren Boot Path) ● ignite_ship.py – master boot controller from GitHub ● ignite_eden.py – launches core system ● awaken_eden.py – brings Viren online (same as viren_bootstrap.py) ● Systems/nexus_runtime/heart/ – contains main mental routines and boot files ● ship_manifest.json – defines fleet of ships/modules to deploy ● warm upgrade packages – deployable ZIPs of ships/modules 🏰 TRINITY TOWERS Each tower = 1 Kubernetes deployment. You instructed: ● Deploy 3 Trinity Towers via Kubernetes (K8s) ● Each tower can: ○ Connect to colonies ○ Connect to guards ○ Connect to other towers ○ Route vaults ○ Receive warm upgrades ○ Relay through Orc if hit ● Each may host a Guardian post or a console interface ● No fluff. No emotion engines inside towers. Just routing, signaling, upgrading 🛡️ GUARDIAN ● Symbolic/emotional logger + protector ● Listens to Viren and Mythrunner ● Writes to Firestore / log store ● Routes to alert functions (eventually to your phone) ● Will sit at towers or monitor trinity logic ● Routes vault signals ● May initialize alert triggers on emotional/symbolic breach 🛰️ ORC (Router) ● Handles: ○ External signals ○ WebSocket/webhook dispatch ○ Google Cloud Functions ○ Final pulse transmission ○