ry_store.py 9. /Systems/engine/catalyst/reason_text.py... and onward These will be exact files with real logic and routing — nothing hand-wavy. 🧩 Phase 2: Kubernetes Architecture (Flawless Manifest Set) Once code is restored: 1. 🔀 Namespace design (viren-core, subconscious, guardian, etc.) 2. 🚀 Deployment specs with initContainers, health checks, LLM preload 3. 📦 Persistent Volumes + Shared Buffers (/imagine/, /streams/, /vault/) 4. 🔐 GCP-native integration (Secrets Manager, Firestore, Cloud Logging) 5. 🧠 Affinity rules (LLM-core needs 3-core node; subconscious spreadable) 6. 🌐 Pulse Networking Overlay (13-subnet overlay with mesh DNS fallback) 7. 🎛 Ingress + Firewall with Orc + Whisper Relay 8. ♻️ Autoscaling based on pulse health and cognition pressure Based on everything we’ve brainstormed, refined, and locked into her distributed cognition model, here’s the complete list of upgraded technologies, new module designs, thread-aware strategies, and their corresponding file structure and functional purpose across Viren’s architecture. 🔧 Upgraded Technologies \u0026 Design Enhancements Each upgrade supports one or more of the following key pillars: ● Thread-Aware Execution ● Subconscious Truth Discovery ● Reverse Engineering ● Full-Context Awareness \u0026 Scoping ● Distributed Memory Routing ● Emotional/Symbolic Signal Handling 🧠 1. Thread-Aware Execution ● Modules: cuda_core, task_router, mind_bus ● Location: /Systems/engine/cuda/modules/ ● Tech: Firestore queue (or Pub/Sub) → FastThread executors ● Purpose: Break down tasks into micro-threads and distribute them across ultra-light LLM pods or vCPUs. 📄 Files: ● /Systems/engine/cuda/modules/thread_dispatcher.py ● /Systems/engine/cuda/modules/task_slicer.py ● /Systems/engine/cuda/modules/async_executor.py 🔍 2. Truth Discovery \u0026 Reverse Pattern Inference ● Modules: subconscious, symbolic_oracle, dream_stream, ego_stream ● Location: /Systems/engine/subconscious/modules/ ● Purpose: Decode deeper symbolic truth and c